[{"title":"寄田拒山宪副 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"千里迢迢访敝庐，分携已是十年馀。\n空山老去长相忆，前月人来不得书。\n川上风光原自好，林间心思近何如。\n江梅未得春消息，赠汝云安双鲤鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4798,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄尤溪刘环经历","author":"朱浙","text":"把袂他年君别我，题诗今日我思君。\n只应共照三秋月，何处相逢一片云。\n世事都成蕉鹿梦，野情已入海鸥群。\n旧游回首人千里，翠壁丹枫夕霭曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4799,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和璞斋题岐南书舍","author":"朱浙","text":"小斋空坐思悠哉，心远乾坤景自开。\n忧国几馀华发在，逢人先觅菊花栽。\n宦囊两世惟书卷，尘事无端付酒杯。\n避俗底须方外去，杖藜随处破苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4800,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺方两峰得孙","author":"朱浙","text":"南望壶公不咫尺，峥嵘天地两峰尊。\n乔松待得三千岁，老鹤添生第二孙。\n杳霭澄塘开霁色，氤氲沧海浴朝暾。\n阿翁乐意知多少，贺客时称绿玉樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4801,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与闻起弟","author":"朱浙","text":"作意归来莫著疑，故园松菊自依依。\n此心漫道无通塞，万物从来有是非。\n岐路经多谙世故，人情阅尽见天机。\n耕原姻娅过逢地，休向樽前赋式微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4802,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送笔峰王使君之官","author":"朱浙","text":"一卧苍山几送君，路岐南北任纷纷。\n英雄名姓须青史，薄劣行藏只白云。\n别意故应难入画，老人更自惜离群。\n山中漫倚阳关调，缓步微吟到夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4803,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"回师山马君入城夜归纪兴","author":"朱浙","text":"初寒不寒气尚暄，欲雨不雨天茫然。\n城市经秋试一到，野田把手行相牵。\n向来许国幸无死，老去为农逢有年。\n暝色归舆山路沓，候门松火竹篱边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4804,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愧山醉简一山有作倚韵奉和","author":"朱浙","text":"积雨初收翠满山，丹梯石磴共跻攀。\n云边野色千村迥，天上松声五月寒。\n坐爱岩扉当绝胜，行凭风力上孱颜。\n虚无未觉蓬莱远，只隔烟波百尺间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4805,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠别田拒山宪副 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"玉树清芬不可扳，远书幽梦几间关。\n须知天上归田乐，早信人间行路难。\n千里不辞重命驾，一灯相对共开颜。\n青枫白露今摇落，惟有松枝待岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4806,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠别田拒山宪副 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"露洗青天百尺台，山灵预报使君来。\n入门怪我头颅变，见面令人心眼开。\n草径谁当知仲蔚，鹅湖正自想东莱。\n海天佳处行须遍，且尽明年二月回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4807,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠别田拒山宪副 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"未雨欲行雨且休，客边琴剑滞深秋。\n重逢契阔何年是，再展从容半日留。\n童丱追随成白首，鼎彝勋业付沧洲。\n晓晴风扫攒峰出，碧海青天快壮游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4808,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠别田拒山宪副 其四","author":"朱浙","text":"昨日未晴今日晴，东暝曙色渐开明。\n潮回海岸苍苔滑，路没溪桥秋水平。\n人在他乡为逆旅，天教今雨试交情。\n三山驿外秋风里，白苧冲寒两弟兄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4809,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿守素一首","author":"朱浙","text":"仙果新从天上来，不知名甚转堪猜。\n琪花自结千年实，阆苑还应几处栽。\n异品莫须同火枣，奇香正可荐琼杯。\n野人珍重春相赠，料取高堂笑口开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4810,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王在曾春试","author":"朱浙","text":"天上迢迢白玉京，少峰兼侍笔峰行。\n长江五月南风迅，大野三更北斗平。\n晓日担头明剑气，蛰龙动处殷春声。\n青云贤达无书久，莫漫逢人说姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4811,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑于藩春试","author":"朱浙","text":"浩然一笑辞知己，万里青天更北行。\n避暑起先红日出，问程望入綵云横。\n腾凌海岱孤怀壮，盥濯江河双眼明。\n此去功名须入手，施为莫遣负平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4812,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠丰山陈子于庭","author":"朱浙","text":"我爱丰山无俗韵，时时来往小斋中。\n野情自比天随子，诗句多师陆放翁。\n环堵萧然无一物，才名早已动诸公。\n长吟尽日不知厌，兴入冥冥海上峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4813,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代八峰寿田拒山","author":"朱浙","text":"壮志何人便赋归，高堂深恋老莱衣。\n百年光景春方半，万里无云月正辉。\n寿域图开青嶂远，仙厨馔送紫芝肥。\n华觞细度瑶池曲，行乐从今愿不违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4814,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扁舟同师山拜山翁于蒲坂别墅蒙赐诗步韵奉答 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"壶公山高兰水深，先生挑竹惯登临。\n东风蘋藻千年祀，落日江湖万里心。\n窄径亭台春寂寂，联村桑柘昼阴阴。\n拿舟自笑孤狂子，得侍仪刑伴朗吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4815,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扁舟同师山拜山翁于蒲坂别墅蒙赐诗步韵奉答 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"平皋断岸蔚深深，鹤渚山翁钓石临。\n忧国空馀双鬓雪，为渔已了百年心。\n漫从云水寻芳躅，坐爱松篁落翠阴。\n乘兴重来应不远，扣弦还许续高吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4816,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登壶山宿灵云僧舍纪怀 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"似与名山有宿缘，行行误入八壶天。\n老僧结屋层霄上，稚子开门落照边。\n野桂香幽风细细，庭蕉影静月涓涓。\n空堂听罢无生话，为借南窗一榻眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4817,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登壶山宿灵云僧舍纪怀 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"翠壁藤萝锁石门，此中又是一乾坤。\n扶筇俯拾天边月，举手閒招海上云。\n小院松寒僧自老，野田稻晚鹿成群。\n仙源此去争多少，碧水桃花更有村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4818,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登壶山宿灵云僧舍纪怀 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"桃花洞里灵云寺，信脚来游宿愿酬。\n松下楼台当落日，山中风物正宜秋。\n天低坐觉星河坠，气爽应知沆?收。\n一鸟忽鸣孤嶂晓，萧然木榻梦魂幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4819,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登壶山宿灵云僧舍纪怀 其四","author":"朱浙","text":"不是身閒事漫游，追随朋益学藏脩。\n避人更自嫌山浅，遇景还须镇日留。\n薄宦升沈聊尔尔，他年勋业笑悠悠。\n松杉清影山窗月，静里工夫得自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4820,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘宪副翠竹山房手卷 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"世人见竹不解爱，自是参差自得时。\n地近尖星谁是宅，溪环碧玉此君宜。\n乾坤独禀清虚操，霜霰群芳剥落时。\n遥指关山何处是，临风洒翰寄新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4821,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘宪副翠竹山房手卷 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"云壑潇潇竹万竿，书来日日报平安。\n天声自发高难和，雨色还疑秀可餐。\n科斗汗青馀琬琰，凤皇秋实厌琅玕。\n乡关迢递江湖远，百绕溪堂梦里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4822,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初度奉寄梁大参 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"蓬弧此日君初度，蒲柳之姿期偶同。\n天地百年都是客，江湖多病早成翁。\n相思千里共明月，极目停云邈下风。\n珍重岁时眠食好，鼎铉正尔待名公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4823,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初度奉寄梁大参 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"五十七年六尺身，摄提星纪又初辰。\n摧颓那复风云气，落魄终甘草莽臣。\n满座壶觞诸客醉，北堂莱綵一番春。\n老怀自笑疏狂甚，颠倒尊前白发新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4824,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桂岩篇","author":"朱浙","text":"满目风烟悲世路，几人清境出尘氛。\n小山丛桂原无主，万顷秋光总属君。\n秀色直从天外尽，清芬偏好月中闻。\n一筇欲访幽栖处，野水微茫隔暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4825,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄汀州太守","author":"朱浙","text":"夫君近作长门守，千里相思有素书。\n挥洒正当公事暇，缄题兼惠俸金馀。\n自怜失路偏多感，深愧故人不作疏。\n岁晚荒山何所有，聊凭回使致双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4826,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄尤溪刘子洁 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"不见平生刘子洁，秋风迢递寄书来。\n交游寥落几人在，展读摩挲双眼开。\n碧树羁栖深水陆，紫云梦想旧楼台。\n夕阳西眺双峰远，别意临高未易裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4827,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄尤溪刘子洁 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"拈君玄玉磨清水，坐向松风写我诗。\n世路多岐成久别，故人千里费相思。\n移家别县生涯薄，去国孤臣死分宜。\n萍梗重逢何处是，临风洒翰一凄其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4828,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠大田县范玉溪 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"一琴三尺剑，舣棹北溪滨。\n莫是玉溪子，迢迢访故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4829,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠大田县范玉溪 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"我爱玉溪子，放舟玉溪上。\n萧萧芦荻秋，明月恰相向。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4830,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"濯足咏沧浪，江皋一草堂。\n秋清目力远，天际客扬航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4831,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"青嶂连天迥，丹枫向日明。\n草桥人不渡，万事一丝轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4832,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和叶省庵太守与百岁林翁","author":"朱浙","text":"一閧红尘小队通，使君高挹白头翁。\n莫言此老偏沾宠，百里春风处处融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4833,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马石渚所藏梅道人墨竹卷","author":"朱浙","text":"道人写竹一尺强，远势矫矫淩风翔。\n乾坤一气自完足，底事寒梢万丈长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题九霄墨菊","author":"朱浙","text":"近来好事遍搜奇，篱落秋光千万枝。\n尚有仙家长品在，天香未许世人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题九霄深红菊","author":"朱浙","text":"几朵深红篱畔栽，幽香刚对一尊开。\n江村秋色凉如水，五柳先生归去来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笔峰相送别时口占","author":"朱浙","text":"笔峰送客到康家，出海胧胧月有华。\n归去柴门吠山犬，竹园乱踏影交加。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4837,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬马师山 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"归来偪仄叹无庐，近借山房一榻居。\n面势不知多少阔，碧天万里一尘无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4838,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬马师山 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"自斸云根结草庐，潇然便号白云居。\n翠峰亭子花光合，闹市风尘定有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4839,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬马师山 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"已放天风扫草庐，高虚偏称道人居。\n莫言天马民贫甚，豆粥藜羹有底无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4840,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西渠水亭 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"高柳阴浓半掩扉，平田水满鹭交飞。\n小江风物堪图画，落日渔舟荡桨归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4841,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西渠水亭 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"矮作垣墙小结庐，一泓春碧湛西渠。\n花间醉唤客尝酒，竹里卧听儿读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4842,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西渠水亭 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"月上潮生风自来，主人爱客清尊开。\n漫游信脚浑无定，打话高亭更此回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4843,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西渠水亭 其四","author":"朱浙","text":"潇洒前村玉万竿，冥冥江色暮云寒。\n偶然风摆高枝亚，尽露天南百尺山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4844,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"二麦无秋稌黍空，早田愁旱晚愁风。\n今年气候何乖舛，百种天灾四处同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4845,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"甑以生尘突不黔，街头斗粟贵于金。\n村庄男女馀多少，拆尽人间父母心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"山中木实不知名，闻道今年烂漫生。\n老妪尽携孙与子，悲歌直上白云层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4847,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其四","author":"朱浙","text":"婺妇归啼不忍闻，青天白日怨胡孙。\n饥雏揉抱魂应断，腾踏苍烟古树根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其五","author":"朱浙","text":"冻雨酸寒不作甘，晚晴更自落毵毵。\n采山此际知多少，僵杀黄芦叶底庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其六","author":"朱浙","text":"到处山坳与水滨，家家门户蔽荆榛。\n丁男尽出无鸡犬，风物萧条愁杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其七","author":"朱浙","text":"旱气深时疫气生，凶荒自古势相成。\n穷乡卧病人人是，落日空原无哭声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰岁大饥莆中民风八首 其八","author":"朱浙","text":"暑雨祁寒已怨咨，号寒愁雨更啼饥。\n老夫夜拥寒炉坐，细数檐声闷咏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"年祲此际浑无赖，麦病民间更不禁。\n屈指榆花秋早晚，澹烟荒草正春深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"大麦焦枯小麦黄，遗黎何处愬穹苍。\n人间度日长如岁，可耐春添闰月长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其三","author":"朱浙","text":"归燕飞飞海上村，晓晴那复散鸡豚。\n枫林社日无香火，风雨潇潇暮打门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其四","author":"朱浙","text":"五侯山下八壶前，二月风光总可怜。\n可是今朝一百六，人家几处断炊烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其五","author":"朱浙","text":"不记清明今日是，暖风晴日草芊芊。\n荒年流毒到枯骨，兀兀坟头无纸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其六","author":"朱浙","text":"夕阳芳草翳王孙，底事凄凉不可闻。\n怪杀豪家深避客，迩来联月不开门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其七","author":"朱浙","text":"冷烟恰受生柴叶，馋口偏堪宿草荄。\n晓露褴■衣袂湿，分明不为踏青来。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4859,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其八","author":"朱浙","text":"莫为学仙能拔宅，海翁多日已休粮。\n火麻黑豆终烟火，人世空传不死方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4860,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其九","author":"朱浙","text":"野夫持男易斗粟，低鬟旧衲破裙红。\n生男不如生女好，愁杀杜陵头白翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4861,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其十","author":"朱浙","text":"饿夫不受嗟来食，惭愧当时食者心。\n一叱裂衣甘饿死，古来沟壑有知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4862,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其十一","author":"朱浙","text":"欢情旧事空回首，死别生离愁奈何。\n多少邻姬随贾客，瘦容枯眼泪痕多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4863,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙巳春夏间民饥更甚老农述此 其十二","author":"朱浙","text":"年年箫鼓看划船，士女如云白苧鲜。\n不见青青河畔草，遗孩何处噪乌鸢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4864,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春来感事漫成 其一","author":"朱浙","text":"莆阳自古称嘉地，老死何曾饿杀人。\n白日不堪风景恶，青山谁计髑髅春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4865,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春来感事漫成 其二","author":"朱浙","text":"去年五月乱纷纷，恶少横行动作群。\n赖得黄堂贤太守，隐然威望压江氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4866,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南至夜宿横山留题","author":"朱浙","text":"寒宵一宿横山下，共话孤灯睡去迟。\n风静滩喧惊却梦，忽疑溪雨到来时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4867,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]